    "type": "question",
    "label": "49",
    "prompt": "Complete the square of the following.\n$$2x^2+3x+1$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2\\left(x+\\frac34\\right)^2-\\frac18$\n\nFactor out $2$, then complete the square inside the brackets.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x^2+3x+1&=2\\left(x^2+\\frac32x+\\frac12\\right)\\\\2x^2+3x+1&=2\\left(\\left(x+\\frac34\\right)^2-\\frac9{16}+\\frac12\\right)\\\\2x^2+3x+1&=2\\left(\\left(x+\\frac34\\right)^2-\\frac1{16}\\right)\\\\2x^2+3x+1&=2\\left(x+\\frac34\\right)^2-\\frac18.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
